WEBVTT

00:00:03.721 --> 00:00:07.922
CANDY CANDY

00:00:10.738 --> 00:00:16.596
Sobakasu nante kinishinai wa.

00:00:17.538 --> 00:00:23.163
Hana pecha datte datte datte oki ni iri.

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:27.101
Otenba itazura daisuki,

00:00:27.136 --> 00:00:30.583
Kakekko sukippu daisuki;

00:00:30.618 --> 00:00:36.088
Watashi wa, watashi wa, watashi wa Candy!

00:00:37.254 --> 00:00:43.357
Hitoripocchi de iru to choppiri samishii.

00:00:43.392 --> 00:00:49.784
Sonna toki kou iu no kagami wo mitsumete:

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:56.358
Waratte, waratte, waratte Candy!

00:00:56.691 --> 00:00:59.399
Nakibeso nante sayonara!

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:02.794
Nee, Candy Candy!

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.133
Tom, the mischievous boy
from Pony's home...

00:01:15.134 --> 00:01:17.685
...was adopted and taken away
by a wealthy farmer named Steve.

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:20.706
Suddenly, Pony's home
feels lonely.

00:01:21.131 --> 00:01:25.038
Take off!
Adventuring together!

00:01:26.721 --> 00:01:29.138
John wet his sheets again!

00:01:29.173 --> 00:01:32.252
You'd better do that before
going to bed! It's embarrassing.

00:01:32.287 --> 00:01:33.579
I'm sorry.

00:01:39.586 --> 00:01:41.108
Why, you!

00:01:41.496 --> 00:01:44.022
Annie, can you catch him?

00:01:52.139 --> 00:01:55.942
Annie, I think Kurin just
wants to eat some dried meat.

00:01:59.724 --> 00:02:01.505
Annie, what's wrong?

00:02:01.889 --> 00:02:03.390
Do you have a fever?

00:02:03.799 --> 00:02:05.121
It's nothing.

00:02:05.157 --> 00:02:06.896
But you don't look good.

00:02:13.535 --> 00:02:17.079
It's good.. having a mother
and a father...

00:02:22.396 --> 00:02:23.800
I got it now, Annie!

00:02:24.619 --> 00:02:27.865
You are ill, after all!

00:02:29.155 --> 00:02:31.378
It's your spirit that is ill.

00:02:32.484 --> 00:02:33.593
Annie!

00:02:34.451 --> 00:02:36.901
It's just that I'm a bit lonely.

00:02:38.138 --> 00:02:42.454
Annie, that's exactly what I was
trying to say. Leave it to me!

00:02:43.739 --> 00:02:44.841
What are you going to do?

00:02:45.667 --> 00:02:49.235
Look forward to the tomorow morning!

00:03:00.373 --> 00:03:03.782
Annie! Hey, Annie!

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:06.571
Candy!

00:03:06.606 --> 00:03:07.581
Sssshh!

00:03:07.616 --> 00:03:09.470
Why so early?

00:03:09.858 --> 00:03:13.490
We are going to cure your spirit!
Now, hurry up and get dressed!

00:03:15.042 --> 00:03:17.405
Sister Lane, I'm so sorry...

00:03:28.717 --> 00:03:30.954
Looks like we'll have some
great weather today!

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:33.699
Candy, is this okay?

00:03:33.734 --> 00:03:35.840
It's okay!
Now, let's go!

00:03:42.047 --> 00:03:44.725
Sister Pony!
Sister Pony!

00:03:45.478 --> 00:03:47.905
Oh, good morning, Sister Lane.

00:03:48.414 --> 00:03:52.349
I've found this note,
Candy and Annie have..

00:03:52.895 --> 00:03:55.417
That's Candy's writing, isn't it?

00:03:56.136 --> 00:03:59.852
"Sister Pony, Sister Lane, Good morning."

00:03:59.887 --> 00:04:06.934
"Annie and I have set on a journey
in order to cure Annie's spirit."

00:04:08.302 --> 00:04:11.739
-To cure her spirit, oh my!
-Sister Pony!

00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:17.078
"I felt that Annie was a bit
under the weather lately,"

00:04:17.363 --> 00:04:21.127
...so that's why I thought
a picnic might cheer her up.

00:04:21.481 --> 00:04:25.176
Candy does these things all the time!

00:04:25.211 --> 00:04:31.287
"We don't know where we'll go,
but we'll come back before dark."

00:04:31.322 --> 00:04:34.275
"Therefore, don't worry."

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:38.410
"Oh, and we also took some bread,
cheese and wine that sister Pony...

00:04:38.445 --> 00:04:40.548
...likes to drink before going to bed."

00:04:40.583 --> 00:04:42.100
Wine?
Oh, my!

00:04:50.816 --> 00:04:52.635
Well then, cheers!

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:54.240
Do you think it's okay?

00:04:54.275 --> 00:04:57.868
Don't worry! Sister Pony drinks
this stuff every night!

00:05:07.918 --> 00:05:09.502
Wonderful!

00:05:10.674 --> 00:05:11.816
Feels great!

00:05:11.851 --> 00:05:15.066
-Candy has disappeared!
-She'll soon come back.

00:05:16.086 --> 00:05:20.839
John, why don't we wait for her in the back?
Help me make some nests for the chicken.

00:05:21.028 --> 00:05:21.755
Okay.

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:22.992
Now, hurry up!

00:05:24.796 --> 00:05:29.265
Sister Pony, I'm going to look
for them after all.

00:05:30.991 --> 00:05:34.937
Sister Lane, I don't think that
it's a good idea.

00:05:34.972 --> 00:05:36.980
Why is that?

00:05:37.015 --> 00:05:41.770
In ten years that Candy and Annie
have been here,

00:05:41.805 --> 00:05:43.012
...not once have we taken them
to a picnic.

00:05:43.047 --> 00:05:45.140
But that's because we had no money.

00:05:45.175 --> 00:05:49.049
They had no money, but that
didn't stop them from going.

00:05:51.351 --> 00:05:55.014
Sister Lane, don't be so hard on them.

00:05:55.049 --> 00:05:57.856
I'm sure they'll have wonderful
memories of this day.

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:01.074
I'm going!

00:06:08.274 --> 00:06:09.548
Candy.

00:06:16.559 --> 00:06:20.091
Candy?
Candy, where are you?

00:06:22.958 --> 00:06:24.890
Candy! I won't forgive you for this!

00:06:27.081 --> 00:06:27.750
Huh?

00:06:32.331 --> 00:06:34.249
Annie, let's catch it!

00:06:35.265 --> 00:06:36.427
Wait up!

00:06:41.758 --> 00:06:44.024
Looks almost as if it's waiting
for us!

00:07:09.432 --> 00:07:11.099
I've grown so thirsty!

00:07:12.207 --> 00:07:13.208
It's cold!

00:07:14.628 --> 00:07:16.944
Annie! It feels good!

00:07:17.641 --> 00:07:20.273
The stream looks too fast!
I'm afraid.

00:07:20.274 --> 00:07:21.578
Leave it to me!

00:07:22.175 --> 00:07:23.216
What are you going to do?

00:07:33.401 --> 00:07:35.912
Tie this end to that tree over there.

00:07:39.484 --> 00:07:40.996
It feels good, doesn't it?

00:07:41.683 --> 00:07:44.059
Candy, I'm glad I came.

00:07:44.107 --> 00:07:46.159
You don't feel so lonely anymore, right?

00:07:46.315 --> 00:07:47.086
Yeah.

00:07:47.484 --> 00:07:48.732
Want to go to the other side?

00:07:50.985 --> 00:07:56.370
Annie!
Don't let go of the rope!

00:07:58.916 --> 00:08:00.701
-Annie!
-Candy!

00:08:02.284 --> 00:08:03.152
Candy!

00:08:05.862 --> 00:08:08.719
Annie! Don't let go of my hand!

00:08:15.953 --> 00:08:20.727
Mr. Brighton, I found some girls here!
They are going to drown if we don't help them!

00:08:21.169 --> 00:08:22.835
That's terrible!

00:08:25.018 --> 00:08:27.302
Both of you, don't let go of that rope!

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:28.866
There!

00:08:29.699 --> 00:08:31.023
I'll help you.

00:08:34.459 --> 00:08:37.017
It's okay.
You're safe now.

00:08:37.487 --> 00:08:39.584
(...you're safe now...)

00:08:39.619 --> 00:08:43.319
(...you're safe now...)

00:08:50.951 --> 00:08:53.608
Lucy, where are the girls?

00:08:53.643 --> 00:08:56.214
Mr. Brighton, just look at them!

00:09:01.134 --> 00:09:02.649
We look a bit different now!

00:09:03.224 --> 00:09:07.637
I prepared something nice for you.
Here, come this way.

00:09:08.181 --> 00:09:11.819
Mr. Brighton, now you have
two girls at home!

00:09:12.211 --> 00:09:14.207
Two girls...

00:09:14.432 --> 00:09:16.596
Smells wonderful!

00:09:16.631 --> 00:09:17.719
Candy!

00:09:19.884 --> 00:09:21.672
Here, come this way!

00:09:23.685 --> 00:09:25.635
How do we eat this stuff?

00:09:26.023 --> 00:09:27.243
It's unusual to you?

00:09:27.438 --> 00:09:30.090
We eat this for the first time!
Right, Annie?

00:09:31.556 --> 00:09:36.252
At Pony's home, we'd get in a lot of trouble
if we didn't eat properly!

00:09:36.831 --> 00:09:38.016
Let's eat!

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:45.183
Tasty!

00:09:49.414 --> 00:09:51.434
Candy, don't pig out.

00:09:53.028 --> 00:09:58.239
No, as for barbecue, it's okay to eat
any way you like it, since it's so tasty.

00:10:01.784 --> 00:10:04.042
It's really tasty!

00:10:08.784 --> 00:10:11.764
By the way, what exactly is
Pony's home?

00:10:11.965 --> 00:10:14.028
Oh, mister, you don't know?

00:10:14.063 --> 00:10:15.849
I don't come very often to this house.

00:10:16.048 --> 00:10:19.044
It's a place for children
without parents.

00:10:19.079 --> 00:10:21.409
Oh, that's so sad.

00:10:21.444 --> 00:10:24.448
But the two of us don't really
look sad, do we?

00:10:24.678 --> 00:10:26.110
Well, not really!

00:10:26.533 --> 00:10:30.106
Do you know why Annie's and
my birthday are on the same day?

00:10:30.322 --> 00:10:33.457
No idea.
You don't really look like twins.

00:10:33.492 --> 00:10:36.777
It's because we were found abandoned
on the same day!

00:10:38.399 --> 00:10:39.662
Candy!

00:10:39.697 --> 00:10:41.599
On the same day!

00:10:47.879 --> 00:10:50.266
Huh?
Is something on my face?

00:10:50.442 --> 00:10:53.020
Huh? No...
Lucy, bring some lemonade.

00:10:53.414 --> 00:10:55.113
Here you go, mr. Brighton!

00:10:55.294 --> 00:10:58.724
-I wonder if it's for us too!
-Candy!

00:10:58.759 --> 00:10:59.585
But...

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:02.001
Here, it's all for you!

00:11:02.036 --> 00:11:05.630
After you eat up, would you
like to ride a horse?

00:11:05.665 --> 00:11:08.539
-Sounds like fun!
-But I'm afraid.

00:11:09.037 --> 00:11:12.034
Don't worry, our horses are calm.

00:11:14.897 --> 00:11:17.621
This horse looks so nice!

00:11:18.351 --> 00:11:19.895
Come on.

00:11:20.525 --> 00:11:21.958
Here you go.

00:11:22.987 --> 00:11:24.009
Go!

00:11:24.544 --> 00:11:25.734
We are moving!

00:11:26.897 --> 00:11:28.774
Of course you are!

00:11:28.809 --> 00:11:29.577
Candy!

00:11:30.293 --> 00:11:33.776
This place became lively again
after such a long time!

00:11:34.331 --> 00:11:38.772
It's almost as if master's
late daughter came back to life.

00:11:50.053 --> 00:11:56.272
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Setting the standard in substandard
translations! Yay!

00:11:58.206 --> 00:11:59.117
You aren't afraid anymore?

00:11:59.152 --> 00:12:00.844
No, because I can hold on to you.

00:12:09.214 --> 00:12:10.987
-Candy?
-What is it?

00:12:11.022 --> 00:12:14.439
Are you sure we aren't dreaming
the same dream?

00:12:14.474 --> 00:12:15.301
Huh?

00:12:15.336 --> 00:12:16.977
Because today was like in a dream.

00:12:17.012 --> 00:12:21.462
Maybe so. Up until today, I've only slept
in a crummy old bed at Pony's home,

00:12:21.463 --> 00:12:24.721
but the bed here looks like it was
made for a princess!

00:12:26.819 --> 00:12:27.964
Well then, Annie.

00:12:29.086 --> 00:12:30.371
Candy?

00:12:31.688 --> 00:12:35.554
-Let's live together with this man.
-What do you mean?

00:12:35.585 --> 00:12:38.951
He could adopt the two of us
as his daughters!

00:12:39.046 --> 00:12:42.026
Annie! How can you say such a thing?

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:46.911
You understand that you can't
stay forever at Pony's home?

00:12:47.305 --> 00:12:49.200
No. I don't want that.

00:12:49.569 --> 00:12:55.100
Listen to me, Candy. If we become his
daughters, we could stay together forever.

00:12:56.527 --> 00:12:59.606
Annie!
When did you become so selfish?

00:12:59.897 --> 00:13:04.327
Like sister Pony was always saying,
abandoning others at any time is wrong!

00:13:04.492 --> 00:13:07.388
But I want to stay together with you!

00:13:07.601 --> 00:13:12.101
And you'd entrust yourself to some
person you've never met before?

00:13:12.282 --> 00:13:14.644
Brightons are good people!

00:13:15.024 --> 00:13:16.680
Well then, do as you like!

00:13:16.853 --> 00:13:18.493
Yes, I will.

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:20.877
I don't know you anymore!

00:13:21.326 --> 00:13:22.974
Candy! Where are you going?

00:13:23.009 --> 00:13:26.817
Back to Pony's home! You can become
their daughter, if you want to!

00:13:27.385 --> 00:13:29.094
Wait, Candy!

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:32.206
-I hate you!
-Wait!

00:13:40.235 --> 00:13:48.067
I want my papa and mama.
Gentle papa and mama.

00:13:59.345 --> 00:14:02.107
John! Where are you?

00:14:05.056 --> 00:14:08.251
Teacher, I looked over there,
but I couldn't find him!

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:10.777
I wonder where'd he go.

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:13.875
Teacher, somebody is coming.

00:14:15.048 --> 00:14:16.922
I wonder who it is...

00:14:19.385 --> 00:14:20.837
Candy!

00:14:21.568 --> 00:14:23.329
What kind of outfit is that?

00:14:23.554 --> 00:14:24.986
What happened to Annie?

00:14:25.801 --> 00:14:27.055
Annie has...

00:14:27.113 --> 00:14:29.743
Candy, John had disappeared.

00:14:29.789 --> 00:14:31.106
What? What happened to him?

00:14:31.141 --> 00:14:33.420
He disappeared right after the lunch.

00:14:33.455 --> 00:14:35.819
He must have gone looking for you.

00:14:36.136 --> 00:14:38.335
John was trying to find us...?

00:14:38.731 --> 00:14:40.256
John!

00:14:40.291 --> 00:14:42.252
Candy, where are you going?

00:14:55.028 --> 00:14:58.149
John!
You're here, after all.

00:15:02.039 --> 00:15:04.323
Candy! You found John?

00:15:04.358 --> 00:15:09.321
-Be quiet.
-Candy, careful.

00:15:09.494 --> 00:15:10.511
Leave it to me!

00:15:35.317 --> 00:15:37.139
That was scary!

00:15:44.619 --> 00:15:48.234
John? John?
Wake up, John!

00:15:55.601 --> 00:15:57.000
Candy!

00:15:57.133 --> 00:15:59.283
Don't give me that,
you got me so worried!

00:15:59.318 --> 00:16:01.238
Hold on tightly until I
get us down!

00:16:01.273 --> 00:16:02.748
Down from where?

00:16:05.084 --> 00:16:06.829
Be careful!

00:16:13.491 --> 00:16:15.410
That's Brightons' carriage!

00:16:15.445 --> 00:16:19.785
Candy? What happened?
Quickly come down! If you do that...

00:16:22.439 --> 00:16:25.456
-Ouch.
-Candy, are you okay?

00:16:26.391 --> 00:16:29.070
That's right, Annie!

00:16:29.105 --> 00:16:31.361
What's all this about?

00:16:32.811 --> 00:16:36.042
Annie! Annie!

00:16:43.842 --> 00:16:45.859
You brought Annie back, didn't you?

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:49.843
Miss, Mr. Brighton is very worried.

00:16:50.061 --> 00:16:51.931
I'm sorry. Where is Annie?

00:16:51.966 --> 00:16:57.729
She'll be staying at the villa tonight.
I just came to see if you safely made it back.

00:16:57.764 --> 00:16:59.487
Annie won't be coming back?

00:16:59.522 --> 00:17:02.186
She reminded him of his late daughter.

00:17:02.384 --> 00:17:06.235
Mr. Brighton's...?
I see.

00:17:16.362 --> 00:17:20.181
We have so much, please eat a lot!

00:17:20.505 --> 00:17:22.026
Yes, thank you!

00:17:22.397 --> 00:17:25.436
You even have Candy's favorite nuts!

00:17:27.782 --> 00:17:29.138
Here, Candy.

00:17:36.488 --> 00:17:39.074
We should have brought that girl, too.

00:17:41.381 --> 00:17:45.026
Lucy, is the stew done yet?
Bring it quickly.

00:17:45.061 --> 00:17:46.609
I will.

00:17:47.523 --> 00:17:51.598
Sister Pony, I'm certain that
Brightons will adopt her tomorrow!

00:17:51.886 --> 00:17:55.908
That's right. Annie probably can't
wait, too.

00:17:56.703 --> 00:18:00.512
I'm sure she'll be okay, becoming
a daughter of a such good family.

00:18:00.944 --> 00:18:03.134
Sister Pony, Sister Lane.

00:18:03.744 --> 00:18:04.759
Candy?

00:18:07.534 --> 00:18:09.706
I hate every single one of you!

00:18:42.286 --> 00:18:44.203
Annie...

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:55.600
Candy.

00:19:12.634 --> 00:19:15.182
She is pretending to sleep.

00:19:15.595 --> 00:19:19.013
She can't sleep either?

00:19:19.597 --> 00:19:25.078
Maybe it's impossible. It's the first
time she sleeps without Annie next to her.

00:19:27.908 --> 00:19:31.113
Sister Lane, let's call it a day.

00:20:02.374 --> 00:20:03.582
Annie!

00:20:04.952 --> 00:20:06.149
Candy.

00:20:08.232 --> 00:20:10.392
It was John...

00:20:29.361 --> 00:20:30.583
Huh?

00:20:31.812 --> 00:20:32.859
Kurin!

00:20:36.505 --> 00:20:39.221
This storm kept you awake, too?

00:20:41.068 --> 00:20:46.029
Annie might not come back.
But I... Kurin?

00:20:50.247 --> 00:20:52.078
Annie.

00:20:55.958 --> 00:20:57.656
Annie?

00:20:59.464 --> 00:21:00.880
Candy.

00:21:01.173 --> 00:21:02.910
It's really Annie.

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:07.952
I wanted to come back.
All night long.

00:21:10.686 --> 00:21:11.906
Candy!

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:21.828
Annie!
I'm so glad.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:27.083
I wanted to see you so much, Candy.

00:21:35.409 --> 00:21:40.858
I couldn't stop thinking about you,
so I came here first thing in the morning.

00:21:41.152 --> 00:21:44.674
I, too, thought all night about you.

00:21:45.416 --> 00:21:49.404
Candy, about me wanting to become
Brighton's daughter...

00:21:49.651 --> 00:21:50.771
Still..?

00:21:51.592 --> 00:21:52.397
No.

00:21:52.641 --> 00:21:56.180
Really? That's great!

00:21:56.356 --> 00:21:57.809
Oh, I remembered.

00:22:05.273 --> 00:22:06.227
These are..?

00:22:06.378 --> 00:22:09.940
I brought them because I knew
how much you like them.

00:22:10.805 --> 00:22:12.243
Annie.

00:22:19.247 --> 00:22:25.069
Annie! We'll be friends forever!
I'll never let go of you ever again!

00:22:25.070 --> 00:22:26.604
That's right!

00:22:27.451 --> 00:22:30.576
The day they met mr. Brighton
turned out to be a wonderful day,

00:22:30.999 --> 00:22:35.664
...a day when Candy and Annie's
friendship grew much stronger.

00:22:35.699 --> 00:22:37.250
To be continued.

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:49.608
Ashita wa doko kara
umarete kuru no

00:22:49.643 --> 00:22:58.950
Watashi wa, ashita ga,
ashita ga suki

00:23:00.069 --> 00:23:08.189
Suteki na koto ga
ari sore

00:23:08.764 --> 00:23:17.964
Watashi wa, ashita ga
ashita ga suki.

00:23:18.274 --> 00:23:26.896
Kirakira hikaru
Kaze no mukou de

00:23:27.089 --> 00:23:36.210
Ano hito ga watashi wo
Watashi wo yondeiru - -

00:23:38.027 --> 00:23:48.776
Candy, Candy, Candy, Candy.

00:23:53.866 --> 00:23:58.224
I told everybody about the barbecue
at the Brightons' place,

00:23:58.259 --> 00:24:00.343
but nobody could understand what
I was talking about!

00:24:00.378 --> 00:24:05.185
But then, Brightons stopped by and told
us that they wanted to adopt Annie.

00:24:06.405 --> 00:24:08.473
But I don't want that!

00:24:08.748 --> 00:24:12.156
I don't want to be separated
from Annie,

00:24:12.191 --> 00:24:13.747
...with whom I've lived together
ever since we were babies!

00:24:14.162 --> 00:24:17.648
Next episode;
"A Good-bye from the carriage."

00:24:17.961 --> 00:24:19.451
See you next time!
